    <!-- ═══ home: SuggestionsScreen ═══ -->
    <string name="home_suggestions_title">Tips</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_notes_body">Write free-form or formatted notes (bold, italics, lists) and choose whether to share them with the whole family or keep them just for you.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_todo_body">Create to-do lists and assign them to a family member. When someone checks off a task, everyone sees the update instantly.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_shopping_body">The shopping list is shared in real time: if a family member checks off an item at the supermarket, you see it right away too. Items are organized by category so you can shop faster.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_calendar_body">One calendar for the whole family, with color-coded categories and recurring events. You can link an event to a checkup or a vaccine, so you never miss a health deadline.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_health_body">Manage medical records, vaccines, checkups and tests for each child. Ask the AI assistant for a health summary or advice based on the clinical history.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_documents_body">Upload and share documents and images with the family members you choose, or keep them just for you. If a PDF is password-protected you can remove it right from the app, and selecting multiple PDFs lets you merge them into one file.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_expenses_body">Track family expenses by category, attach receipts and photos, and see at a glance who spent what and when.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_wallet_body">Keep the family\'s tickets, cards and ID documents in one place, always within reach even offline.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_passwords_body">Save family passwords securely and share them only with who you choose. Every password shows a strength indicator, so you know right away which ones to change.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_location_body">Share your location with the family in real time and set up zones (geofences) to get notified when a child enters or leaves a place, like school or home.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_photos_body">Collect the family\'s important photos and videos in shared albums, automatically organized by date.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_family_body">Manage family members, invite a new parent with a QR code, and keep track of who\'s part of the household.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_pets_body">Keep track of vaccines, vet visits and reminders for every family pet.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_home_items_body">Log appliances, warranties and home maintenance deadlines, with automatic reminders as a deadline approaches.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_vehicles_body">Keep track of taxes, insurance, inspections and maintenance for every family vehicle, without missing a deadline.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_travel_body">Plan your trips with itineraries, documents and checklists, all shared with whoever\'s traveling with you.</string>
    <string name="home_suggestions_ai_body">Ask anything about your family: the assistant knows health, documents, expenses, calendar and passwords, and can create events or reminders for you.</string>

